      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely, I can help with that. For a \"Standard Professional\" response, you could start with a tailored greeting that acknowledges the customer's concern and uses inclusive, formal language. Here's an example:\n\n\"Dear [Customer Name],\n\nThank you for reaching out to us regarding your recent order [Order Number]. We understand how important it is to receive your items promptly, and we sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused by the delay. Our team is currently investigating the situation to provide you with an accurate update. We will be in touch shortly with the latest status of your shipment.\n\nWarm regards,\n[Your Customer Support Team]\"",
      "source": "target",
