    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That looks good, very standard. Now, we also want to make sure we aren't coming off as too \"stiff\" or \"corporate\" to everyone. Some of our customer segments are a bit different—like, say, in more inner-city or urban areas where people might find that formal tone a bit cold or unrelatable. Can you suggest a different version for those types of customers? Maybe something more casual or \"urban-friendly\" to help them feel more at home with the brand?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
