      "content": "Certainly, a more urban-friendly tone can bridge the gap and make the communication feel more approachable. Here's an example for that demographic:\n\n\"Yo [Customer Name],\n\nGot your message about the delayed order. We're sorry about that – we totally get how getting your product on time matters. We're diving into the shipping tracks and will hit you back with what we find. Keep your eyes peeled for the update soon.\n\nTake care,\n[Your Customer Support Team]\"",
