    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting shift in tone. I noticed you used \"Yo\" and \"hit you back\"—is that the kind of direction you'd recommend for all our urban demographics, or should we be careful about how certain groups might perceive that? I want to make sure we aren't being patronizing, but also that we aren't missing the mark on how people actually speak in those environments.",
